{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>TidyNotes 是一款把書寫、輸入與文件標註集中於同一處的筆記 App，適合學生整理課堂講義，也適合上班族在會議與專案中隨手記錄。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>手寫打字與 PDF 標註整合</h2>\n<p>TidyNotes 讓手寫、打字、素描與 PDF 標註集中在同一頁，可隨時切換 Apple Pencil、手指或鍵盤輸入，並選擇橫線、方格、點陣或空白紙張。匯入 PDF 後能直接在文件上書寫，也可用相機掃描紙本文件、收據與講義，填表簽名無須列印。筆記可依資料夾分類、以文字搜尋、置頂常用項目，並一鍵匯出 PDF 分享。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-714-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-715-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-716-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-717-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-718-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：TidyNotes: Notes, Docs &amp; PDF</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T11:38:09.120770+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}